---
kind: lore
id: south.tidewellTown
title: Tidewell — services, the derby, the pier, the lighthouse and the cape
---

// ── Monster Center and Mart ──────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="center" on="heal" target="town.tidewell" title="Monster Center" once="false">
  ::use{component="nurse" town="tidewell"}
</beat>

<beat id="mart" on="shop" target="town.tidewell" title="Mart" once="false">
  ::use{component="shop" stock="tidewellStock"}
</beat>

// ── The town, by slot; Sundays are derby days ───────────────────────────

<beat id="derbyRadio" on="dayStart" title="Derby day on the radio" priority="40" once="day" when="@southDerbyDay">
  @announcer: And it's Sunday, which means one thing on the south coast: the Tidewell Derby! Pim tells us this week's prize fish is, and I quote, "a secret, but it's a Seahorsling."
</beat>

<entry id="southTidewellDerbyDay" on="enterTown" target="town.tidewell" category="bark" priority="5" once="day" when="@southDerbyDay">
  @narrator: Bunting from every mast. Half of Tidewell is on the pier with a rod, and the other half is selling the first half sandwiches. It's derby day.
</entry>

<entry id="southTidewellMorning" on="enterTown" target="town.tidewell" category="bark" once="day" when="@isMorning">
  @narrator: The fishing boats come in with the morning. Gulls follow them like a bad reputation.
</entry>

<entry id="southTidewellDay" on="enterTown" target="town.tidewell" category="bark" once="day" when="run.slot == 'day'">
  @narrator: Nets drying, shutters open, somebody's radio playing the shipping forecast in a kitchen with the door propped open.
</entry>

<entry id="southTidewellNight" on="enterTown" target="town.tidewell" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator: The lighthouse beam sweeps the harbour every eight seconds. In between, Tidewell is very dark and very quiet and smells of the sea.
</entry>

// ── Old Salt Morrow (the Old Rod is south.oldSalt) ───────────────────────

<entry id="southMorrowNight" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellMorrow" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @tidewellMorrow: Night fishing. That's when the big ones come up to look at the lighthouse. They like it. Don't ask me why. Ask them.
</entry>

<entry id="southMorrow" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellMorrow" category="bark">
  <match on="quest.southOldSalt.state">
    <when is="complete">
      @tidewellMorrow{emotion="laughing"}: The student has become the fisherman! Sit. Don't talk. That's the last lesson.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @tidewellMorrow: Patience. Water. Rod. In that order. You're holding it upside down.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

// ── Pim, the derby host ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="southPimDerby" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellPim" category="bark" priority="10" when="@southDerbyDay && quest.southDerby.state == 'active'">
  @tidewellPim: Any luck? No Seahorsling yet? The day's young! It's not young. But it's still day!
</entry>

<entry id="southPimWon" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellPim" category="bark" priority="5" when="quest.southDerby.state == 'complete'">
  @tidewellPim{emotion="happy"}: The trophy winner! Your name's on the board in the harbour office. Well. Chalk. But it's big chalk.
</entry>

<entry id="southPim" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellPim" category="bark">
  @tidewellPim: The derby's on Sunday! Every Sunday! It's always on Sunday! If it's not Sunday, it's not the derby, it's just fishing.
</entry>

// ── Isla, the lighthouse keeper ──────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="lighthouse" on="enterPlace" target="place.tidewellLighthouse" title="The lighthouse" priority="10">
  @narrator: A hundred and twelve steps up. At the top, the great lens turns slowly in its bath of oil, and Isla is polishing it with a sock.
  @tidewellIsla: You climbed all the way up? Then you've earned the view. That's Portvolt, across the strait. You can see the Meridian from here when she comes in.
  ::give{item="superPotion"}
</beat>

<entry id="southLighthouseNight" on="enterPlace" target="place.tidewellLighthouse" category="bark" once="day" when="@isNight">
  @narrator: From the top of the lighthouse at night you can see the lights of Eclipse boats in the strait, running dark except for one red lamp each.
</entry>

<entry id="southIslaMorning" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellIsla" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isMorning">
  @tidewellIsla: I sleep in the mornings. The lamp doesn't. One of us has to.
</entry>

<entry id="southIslaNight" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellIsla" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @tidewellIsla: Eight seconds, dark, eight seconds, light. Every ship in the strait knows this light by its count. Ours is eight. Portvolt's is five. Eclipse's boats don't count at all.
</entry>

<entry id="southIsla" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellIsla" category="bark">
  @tidewellIsla: The lens came from a lighthouse up north that fell into the sea. It remembers. It turns a little faster in storms, as if it's nervous.
</entry>

// ── Noor, Marin's sister ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

<entry id="southNoorNight" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellNoor" category="bark" priority="10" when="@isNight">
  @tidewellNoor: Marin's at the bridge doing night lengths. She thinks nobody knows. Everybody knows.
</entry>

<entry id="southNoor" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellNoor" category="bark">
  <match>
    <when test="@badgeCount >= 2">
      @tidewellNoor{emotion="smug"}: You beat Marin? She's been swimming lengths all afternoon to get over it. She'll be fine. She'll be very fit.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @tidewellNoor: Marin says she'll battle anyone. She means anyone who can swim. Can you swim? Can your monsters?
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

// ── The pier ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat id="pier" on="enterPlace" target="place.tidewellPier" title="The fishing pier" priority="10">
  @narrator: The Tidewell fishing pier: a long finger of planks pointing at Portvolt. At the very end, a small old man in a big old hat, not moving.
</beat>

<entry id="southPierDerby" on="enterPlace" target="place.tidewellPier" category="bark" once="day" when="@southDerbyDay">
  @narrator: Shoulder to shoulder on the pier, rods out, lines tangled, nobody speaking: the derby is serious business. Pim's desk is at the landward end.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="tidewellFishermanNed" who="tidewellFishermanNed" intro="You made my float bob! That's the only bite I've had all day and it was you! Battle!" win="Still no bite." lose="At least I caught a win!" prize="340"/>

<entry id="southTidewellFishermanNedAfter" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellFishermanNed" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(tidewellFishermanNed))">
  @tidewellFishermanNed: An Old Rod catches Goldfinn, and only Goldfinn. Old Salt gives one to anyone who sits with him. He gave me one forty years ago.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="tidewellFishermanOskar" who="tidewellFishermanOskar" intro="I've won the derby six times! Six! Want to see my trophy? Battle me first!" win="Seven times, next Sunday. Watch." lose="Six-time champion!" prize="360"/>

<entry id="southTidewellFishermanOskarAfter" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellFishermanOskar" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(tidewellFishermanOskar))">
  <match on="quest.southDerby.state">
    <when is="complete">
      @tidewellFishermanOskar: You got a Seahorsling on derby day. On your first try. I'm going to need a minute. A long minute. Maybe a week.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @tidewellFishermanOskar: Seahorslings bite on Sundays. Only Sundays. I've a theory it's because they're religious.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="tidewellSailorBrett" who="tidewellSailorBrett" intro="Ahoy! A landlubber on my dock! Hands up and monsters out!" win="Sunk! Clean sunk!" lose="Back to shore with you!" prize="320"/>

<entry id="southTidewellSailorBrettAfter" on="talk" target="npc.tidewellSailorBrett" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(tidewellSailorBrett))">
  @tidewellSailorBrett: The Meridian? Finest ferry in Verdane. Captain Orla runs her tight as a drum. You'll need a ticket, and tickets are rarer than Seahorslings this month.
</entry>

// ── The cape (first visit: south.cape; the ticket: south.cassius) ────────

<entry id="southCapeAgain" on="enterPlace" target="place.tidewellCape" category="bark" once="day">
  @narrator: The wind on the cape never stops. The Galewing weathervane points north today, where the flocks are going.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="capeBirdKeeperWyn" who="capeBirdKeeperWyn" intro="Shh! I'm counting Galewings for Cassius. You made me lose count. Now I have to battle you and start again." win="One, two... never mind." lose="Right. From the top. One..." prize="300"/>

<entry id="southCapeBirdKeeperWynAfter" on="talk" target="npc.capeBirdKeeperWyn" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(capeBirdKeeperWyn))">
  @capeBirdKeeperWyn: The flocks go around the Eclipse boats. A whole mile around. Birds know. Cassius says birds always know.
</entry>

<entry id="southCassiusAfter" on="talk" target="npc.cassius" category="bark" when="holds(hasItem(ferryTicket))">
  <match>
    <when test="@badgeCount >= 3">
      @cassius{emotion="happy"}: You've been across! Did you see the Sealpups off Portvolt? Did you count them? Never mind. Tell me about the sea.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @cassius: Still here? The Meridian won't wait. Well, she will, she's a boat. But Captain Orla won't.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</entry>
